flowchart TD
    A[Incoming normalized state] --> B[Urgent safety checks]
    B --> C{Urgent or death?}
    C -- yes --> D[Episode and pinning rules]
    C -- no --> E[Duplicate suppression]
    E --> F[Game-time spacing]
    F --> G{Long silence?}
    G -- yes --> H[Heartbeat nudge]
    G -- no --> I[No new advice]
    D --> J[Final advice]
    E --> K{Suppressed?}
    K -- yes --> I
    K -- no --> F
    H --> J
    J --> L[Overlay response]
